## Git

**Git** is an open-source Distributed Version Control System.

Git is used to:

* Version-control source code changes
* Track source code changes
* Maintain source code history
* Perform parallel development using branching

### Git vs GitHub

| Tool   | Purpose                               |
| ------ | ------------------------------------- |
| Git    | Manages local repositories            |
| GitHub | Hosts and manages remote repositories |

