# Working With Remote Repositories — GitHub

## Remote Repository Workflow

```text
Developer
    |
    | git clone
    ↓
Local Repository
    |
    | git add
    ↓
Staging Area
    |
    | git commit
    ↓
Local Repository
    |
    | git push
    ↓
